여 조위를 격파하고, 승승장구하여 강주로 진격했다. 이듬해, 방악은 이이와 함께 조위를 배반하고 그를 참살했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1041215","remark":"粗壮","surname":"李","surnameTc":"李","surnameEn":"Li","surnameJp":"李","surnameKr":"이","surnameOther":"","name":"异","nameTc":"異","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"異","nameKr":"이","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"李异1","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1045","gender":"0","rule":"62","force":"68","wise":"29","politics":"17","charm":"40","will":"40","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"3","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"32/68/40/41/33/37/29/41","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3800","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"1200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1002305","professions":"1/3/0/0/1/0/1/0/0/0/2/1/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/2/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"1","compatible":"94","loyalty":"0","reputation":"150","evaluate":"-6000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"167","show":"184","death":"226","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"2","weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1019505","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"1/1;7/1;13/2;22/2;28/1;10/0;46/0;0/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"刘璋麾下赵韪部将。建安四年，赵韪起兵反叛，攻打刘璋，将其击退至成都。刘璋奋力反击，将赵韪击败，并乘胜进击江州。次年，庞乐与李异一同反叛赵韪，并将他斩杀。","descriptionTc":"劉璋麾下趙韙部將。建安四年，趙韙起兵反叛，攻打劉璋，將其擊退至成都